    {
      "text": "You can view, edit, delete, or organize forwarding policies and configure routing settings when required."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Editing a Policy",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "To edit a policy:"
    },
    {
      "item": "From the navigation menu, go to Zero Trust Branch > Deployments > Sites.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          32,
          49
        ],
        [
          52,
          63
        ],
        [
          66,
          71
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Sites page, locate the entry for the site whose forwarding policy you want to edit, and click the name of the site in the Site Name column.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          12
        ],
        [
          129,
          138
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the site details page, click the Forwarding Policy tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          36,
          53
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Locate the policy that you want to edit, click the corresponding Gear icon, and select Edit.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          65,
          69
        ],
        [
          87,
          91
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Edit Forwarding Rule drawer, make the necessary changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          27
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The policy changes are saved.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Commit to apply the changes.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 7,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "heading": "Reordering Policies",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "You can reorder policies to change the order of evaluation."
    },
    {
      "text": "To reorder policies:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Zero Trust Branch > Deployments > Sites.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          23
        ],
        [
          26,
          37
        ],
        [
          40,
          45
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Sites page, locate the entry for the site whose forwarding policies must be reordered, and click the name of the site in the Site Name column.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          12
        ],
        [
          132,
          141
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the site details page, click the Forwarding Policy tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          36,
          53
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Reorder.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "A Drag icon appears for each custom policy.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          2,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click and drag each policy to the desired position using the Drag icon.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          61,
          65
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save policy reorder.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          25
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
