    {
      "heading": "Configuring Routing Settings",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "You can configure Zero Trust Branch to use local learned routes over Internet & SaaS (ZIA) and Private Access (ZPA) policies."
    },
    {
      "text": "To configure route preference:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Zero Trust Branch > Deployments > Sites.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          23
        ],
        [
          26,
          37
        ],
        [
          40,
          45
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Sites page, locate the entry for the site whose forwarding policy settings must be updated, and click the name of the site in the Site Name column.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          12
        ],
        [
          137,
          146
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "On the site details page, click the Forwarding Policy tab.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          36,
          53
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Settings.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Policy Routing Settings drawer:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          30
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Enable or disable Prefer local learned routes over the ZIA and ZPA policies.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          18,
          75
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "WAN Failover Settings:",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          21
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Switchover Threshold: Drag the slider to specify the minimum WAN score difference required to initiate failover. The default value is 6.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ],
        [
          11,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Performance SLA Metrics: Enable or disable the following metrics used to evaluate WAN performance:",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          23
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Packet Loss: Enable to include packet loss in WAN performance evaluation.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Latency: Enable to include latency in WAN performance evaluation.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          7
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Jitter: Enable to include jitter in WAN performance evaluation.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
